# What a creature's Hit Dice are levels in. A stat block prints
# 'HP 94 (9d10 + 45)', and those nine d10s are what make a Troll
# a monster rather than a species carrying a Troll's ability
# scores. One class per die size, because in the 2024 rules the
# die follows the creature's size.

CLASS:Monster Hit Die d4	HD:4	TYPE:Monster	MAXLEVEL:50	FACT:ClassType|Monster	VISIBLE:NO
CLASS:Monster Hit Die d4	STARTSKILLPTS:0	MODTOSKILLS:NO
1:REPEATLEVEL:1	DONOTADD:SKILLPOINTS
CLASS:Monster Hit Die d6	HD:6	TYPE:Monster	MAXLEVEL:50	FACT:ClassType|Monster	VISIBLE:NO
CLASS:Monster Hit Die d6	STARTSKILLPTS:0	MODTOSKILLS:NO
1:REPEATLEVEL:1	DONOTADD:SKILLPOINTS
